       -1 |-> BUILTINS )\n    </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 2 => 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack>\n      ListItem(frame(.K, 0, 1)) => .List\n    </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    requires I >=Int 0\n     andBool I +Int 1 <Int isLen(CS)\n    [priority(40)]"
