/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-11-       <scopes> ... L |-> scope(M:Map => M [ X <- V ], _) ... </scopes>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-12-  rule <k> Assign(Name(X:String), V:Val) => #cellW({M[X]}:>Val, V) ... </k>
